  "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "c7e2eb58-b7aa-4ea3-aa65-33d1a2949abc"],
 " for the full enumeration."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"52433bc1-f84b-4c2a-91b2-3d621e09ce0c"]
